epos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":10794598,"digest":"sha256:3e21f870814938f5dd80cffd63303d09498bfe3ea195f3acc1767092993f2b01","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-11-23T14:32:34Z","updated_at":"2026-11-23T14:32:35Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/spockverse/WUBROT/releases/download/v0.2.183/WUBROT-setup.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spockverse/WUBROT/tarball/v0.2.183","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spockverse/WUBROT/zipball/v0.2.183","body":"Windows x64 VST3 stable release.\n\n- Three factory presets with bundled ROT DNA: RIDDIM MONSTER, LIQUID GLASS and METAL TEETH.\n- Branded installer and uninstaller with updated artwork and credits.\n- Recovery from missed preset-completion UI state messages on Windows.\n- In-plugin update checking and downloads from this public release repository.\n\n**Install:** Download `WUBROT-setup.zip`, extract it, fully close your DAW and run `WUBROT-setup.exe`. The installer is unsigned; Windows may show Unknown publisher. Keep only one WUBROT bundle in your DAW scan folders.\n\n**Portable / in-plugin updates:** `WUBROT-0.2.183-Windows-x64.zip` contains the complete VST3 bundle. The plugin verifies the download and applies updates after the DAW exits.\n\nRequires Windows x64 and a VST3 host. Setup installs Microsoft's WebView2 Runtime if needed. Dependency notices are bundled with the plugin. Plugin source code is maintained privately.\n"}